    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> xia-chao created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14886#discussion_r4335980353\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>no real measurement. just worried 10 ms is tight on a loaded ci box, so i kept 100 ms. probably overkill, but flaky tests are worse.</p>\n</blockquote>",
